                        <div class="tab-content" id="myTabContent">
                            <!-- Program -->
                            <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="faq-1-pane" role="tabpanel"
                                aria-labelledby="faq-1" tabindex="0">

                                <div class="accordion" id="accordian-faq01">

                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button " type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                data-bs-target="#collapseafaq01a" aria-expanded="true"
                                                aria-controls="collapseafaq01a">
                                                <span class="z-3">What is the Advanced Program in Applied Data Analytics
                                                    & Generative AI by E&ICT Academy, IIT Roorkee?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="collapseafaq01a" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    The Advanced Program in Applied Data Analytics & Generative AI by
                                                    E&ICT Academy, IIT Roorkee, is a comprehensive, industry-focused
                                                    course designed to build strong skills in data analytics and
                                                    generative AI. It prepares learners for AI-driven careers through
                                                    hands-on projects, practical learning, and guidance from expert
                                                    faculty.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01b"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01b">
                                                <span class="z-3">Who should enroll in this program?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01b" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Fresh graduates, working professionals, data analysts, software
                                                    engineers, and anyone interested in upskilling in data analytics and
                                                    generative AI can enroll. Basic technical knowledge is helpful but
                                                    not mandatory.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01c"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01c">
                                                <span class="z-3">What topics and tools are covered in the
                                                    curriculum?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01c" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    The curriculum covers Python, statistics, machine learning, deep
                                                    learning, LLMs, RAG, multimodal AI, and agentic AI. Tools include
                                                    TensorFlow, PyTorch, SQL, Tableau, and modern generative AI
                                                    platforms for comprehensive learning.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01d"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01d">
                                                <span class="z-3">How is this program different from a regular
                                                    Generative AI course?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01d" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Unlike standalone GenAI courses, this program integrates applied
                                                    data analytics with generative AI. It covers end-to-end workflows
                                                    from data preparation to AI deployment, making you versatile across
                                                    analytics and AI roles
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01e"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01e">
                                                <span class="z-3">Are the classes live or self‑paced?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01e" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Classes are primarily live instructor-led sessions with recordings
                                                    available. The learning management system provides self-paced
                                                    materials, allowing you to revisit concepts, complete assignments,
                                                    and balance work with studies effectively.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01f"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01f">
                                                <span class="z-3">Do I need prior coding or AI experience to
                                                    join?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01f" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Basic mathematics and programming knowledge is recommended but not
                                                    mandatory. The program starts with fundamentals and progresses
                                                    gradually, making it suitable for motivated beginners and
                                                    intermediate learners seeking AI careers.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq01g"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq01g">
                                                <span class="z-3">Will I receive a certificate from E&ICT Academy IIT
                                                    Roorkee?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq01g" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq01">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Yes, upon successful completion of all requirements and the capstone
                                                    project, you receive a co-branded certificate from E&ICT Academy IIT
                                                    Roorkee, which is highly respected and recognized by employers.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                </div>


                            </div>
                            <!-- Projects -->
                            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="faq-2-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-2"
                                tabindex="0">

                                <div class="accordion" id="accordian-faq02">
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button " type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                data-bs-target="#collapseafaq02a" aria-expanded="true"
                                                aria-controls="collapseafaq02a">
                                                <span class="z-3">What types of projects and capstone work are
                                                    included?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="collapseafaq02a" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq02">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    You'll work on industry-oriented projects including data analytics
                                                    pipelines, predictive modeling, chatbot development, LLM
                                                    applications, RAG systems, and image generation. The capstone
                                                    project showcases your end-to-end problem-solving skills
                                                    comprehensively.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button " type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                data-bs-target="#collapseafaq02b" aria-expanded="false"
                                                aria-controls="collapseafaq02b">
                                                <span class="z-3">Are the projects based on real industry datasets and
                                                    problem statements?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="collapseafaq02b" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq02">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Yes, all projects use real-world datasets and industry problem
                                                    statements. This ensures you gain practical experience that directly
                                                    applies to workplace scenarios, preparing you for actual analytics
                                                    and AI challenges effectively.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseafaq02c"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseafaq02c">
                                                <span class="z-3">Will mentors guide me during project execution and
                                                    code reviews?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="collapseafaq02c" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq02">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Yes, experienced mentors provide guidance throughout project
                                                    execution. They conduct code reviews, offer feedback, clarify
                                                    doubts, and help you refine your solutions, ensuring you learn
                                                    industry best practices and standards.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                </div>

                            </div>
                            <!-- Career -->
                            <div class="tab-pane fade" id="faq-3-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-3"
                                tabindex="0">
                                <div class="accordion" id="accordian-faq03">
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button " type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                data-bs-target="#collapseafaq03a" aria-expanded="true"
                                                aria-controls="collapseafaq03a">
                                                <span class="z-3">What career opportunities can I expect after
                                                    completing this program?</span>
                                            </button>

                                        </div>
                                        <div id="collapseafaq03a" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq03">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    You can pursue roles like Data Analyst, Generative AI Engineer, Data
                                                    Scientist, BI Analyst, and AI Specialist. These
                                                    positions are in high demand across IT, finance, healthcare,
                                                    e-commerce, and consulting sectors.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
