                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq03b"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq03b">
                                                <span class="z-3">Does the program provide placement or career
                                                    support?</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq03b" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq03">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Yes, the program offers career support by the industry partner,
                                                    including resume building, LinkedIn optimization, mock interviews,
                                                    and job placement assistance. You'll connect with hiring partners
                                                    actively seeking analytics and AI professionals for various roles.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="accordion-item">
                                        <div class="accordion-header  overflow-hidden">
                                            <button class="accordion-button  collapsed" type="button"
                                                data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordian-faq03c"
                                                aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordian-faq03c">
                                                <span class="z-3">Can international learners or non‑Indian residents
                                                    enroll in this program?</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordian-faq03c" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                            data-bs-parent="#accordian-faq03">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">
                                                <p>
                                                    Yes, international learners can enroll if they meet technical and
                                                    language requirements. They must be able to attend live sessions in
                                                    the scheduled time zone and have stable internet connectivity for
                                                    effective participation.
                                                </p>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
